  "IMG_0002.PNG",
  "IMG_0003.PNG",
  "IMG_0004.PNG",
  "IMG_0005.PNG",
  "IMG_0006.PNG",
  "IMG_0007.PNG",
  "IMG_0008.PNG",
].map((fileName, index) => ({
  alt: `Lurelia app screenshot ${index + 1}`,
  src: `/img/lurelia/${fileName}`,
}));
*/
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Lurelia"
  description="Build routines, habits, reminders, journeys, events, timelines, and Kanban plans with flexible tracking, widgets, automation, and shared-event tools in Lurelia."
>
  <main class="lurelia-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet Lurelia</p>

        <h1>Turn the things you want to keep doing into a system you can actually live with.</h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
          Lurelia is a personal planning and consistency system built around
          routines, habits, reminders, journeys, events, and day-to-day execution.
          Build detailed routines with reusable task templates and contracts,
          track habits and reminders, organize long-term journeys into milestones
          and steps, manage events and shared events, work from a unified timeline,
          and move tasks through Kanban boards without losing the context around them.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Lurelia links">
          <a class="primary-button raised-button" href="#features">
            Explore Features
          </a>

          <a class="secondary-button raised-button" href="/contact">
            Contact Support
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-showcase reveal reveal-delay">
        <div class="showcase-card main-card">
          <span class="mini-label">Your Day in Lurelia</span>

          <h4>Routines, habits, reminders, events, and plans stay connected.</h4>

          <div class="progress-line">
            <span></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-one">
          <span>Timeline</span>
          <strong>See what is due and act from one place</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-two">
          <span>Routines</span>
          <strong>Start, pause, resume, and complete flexible flows</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <GradientDivider />

    <section class="intro-section reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">One Connected Planning System</p>

      <h2>Your routines, habits, reminders, events, and long-term goals should not compete for separate attention.</h2>

      <p>
        Lurelia brings recurring actions, one-off reminders, routines, habits,
        journeys, events, timeline planning, and Kanban organization into one
        personal system. Instead of managing each kind of commitment in isolation,
        you can keep the structure around your days together and work from the
        view that makes the most sense in the moment.
      </p>
    </section>

